An original mark — a price tag seen through a reticle, the tag's price bar
in the accent teal — as SVG in light and dark colourways, plus a wordmark;
the same mark is inlined in the dashboard header and used as the favicon,
drawn with currentColor so it follows the theme. No relation to any
marketplace's branding.

The README is rewritten in the fork owner's house style: a picture that
switches with the reader's colour scheme, an ASCII diagram of the flow,
"why this fork exists" told through the production failures that motivated
it, what is added over upstream grouped by what it does for you, the
config that actually matters, the Portainer stack, the agent, and a Slovak
section. Upstream's README stays alongside as README.upstream.md.
